 # Changelog
 
+## 0.15.15-smart-ai-activity-rebuild-private
+
+- Replaced the disconnected guided-response path with a secure, cloud-first conversational study assistant using the existing authenticated backend and OpenAI Responses API.
+- Added app-managed multi-turn context, current Daily Text/weekly meeting/Family Worship context, verified local official-source excerpts, direct-answer quality checks, tailored follow-up questions, and an explicit private-offline mode.
+- Kept OpenAI credentials off the phone, disabled provider-side response storage for study requests, and restricted web research to JW.org and Watchtower Online Library.
+- Rebuilt all 16 color-by-number pages as curated child-friendly scenes with large meaningful closed regions, reliable tap masks, limited palettes, visible progress, hints, undo/redo, reset, and a completed-picture reveal.
+- Reworked find-the-differences interaction so both pictures are tappable, answers are not exposed in a list, feedback is immediate, hints are staged, and completion is tracked visually.
+- Updated printable PDF output to use the same curated line art, region numbering, and completed colors as the Android activity.
+- Increased phone version code to 48 and Wear OS version code to 360165001 for an in-place upgrade from 0.15.14.
+
 ## 0.12.1-grounded-links-private
 
 - Enforced a verified source marker at the end of every substantive AI answer paragraph, not merely somewhere in the answer.
